{
 "brand": "Gentle Monster",
 "title": "Threshold of the Rainy Night",
 "subtitle": "Gentle Monster Seongsu: A Threshold of Rain and Light.",
 "line": "A transition from the chaotic city rain into a sanctuary of eternal, silent stillness.",
 "quote": "The world falls silent at the edge of the stone.",
 "synopsis": "You step out of the rain and cross the threshold into a place where sound ceases to exist. Moving within the mirrored chamber, you find yourself drawn to monolith one, a dark, tactile center for the products. The low light from above reflects on the black stone surfaces, creating an intimate, quiet experience. It is a moment of stillness where time feels suspended.",
