  {
   "t": "The mirrored walls create an infinite",
   "d": "A walled chamber (mirrored chamber wall), 11 x 8 m, stands inside the room; you enter it through a 1.8 m opening in its side. The mirrored walls create an infinite, immersive environment that separates you from the busy outside world."
  },
  {
   "t": "Monolith one serves as a quiet, heavy focal",
   "d": "Three low monoliths (monolith one) inside it carry the product at 0.9-1.4 m high. Monolith one serves as a quiet, heavy focal point for your discovery of the collection."
  },
  {
   "t": "The piercing blocks introduce structural",
   "d": "Two blocks (piercing block two) break through the chamber walls on opposite sides. The piercing blocks introduce structural tension, suggesting the outside world pressing against your sanctuary."
  },
  {
   "t": "Placing essential services outside the central",
   "d": "The pay desk (subtle pay desk) and the fitting room (dark fitting cube) stay outside the chamber. Placing essential services outside the central chamber ensures the core space remains undisturbed and serene."
  }
